WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.811
Use can, could, may, might, must, should and would to show ability, likelihood, duty

00:00:04.811 --> 00:00:05.469
or advice.

00:00:06.283 --> 00:00:10.571
Which sentence expresses possibility? Answer: It might rain later.

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:15.909
Explain changes in meaning when must is replaced with might in safety rules.

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:19.237
Why it works: Might signals possibility.
